      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper deals with the timely detection and treatment of a menacing complication during endovascular interventions, such as coronary arterial perforation. It describes the causes of perforations, their classification, and an algorithm of actions to eliminate this complication. A clinical example demonstrates the sequence of operations for the detection and correction of coronary arterial perforation."},
